                                               'or image.\n'
                                               'runtime_id: SDK runtime label; empty when this kind has no runtime '
                                               'label.\n'
                                               'part_id: Owning Part UUID when applicable; None means no Part '
                                               'ownership.\n'
                                               'parent_id: Deformation or organization parent UUID when applicable.\n'
                                               'enabled: Whether the scene object is enabled; true for metadata '
                                               'without that field.\n'
                                               'mesh_id: Bound mesh UUID for mesh bindings; None for other '
                                               'collections.\n'
                                               'width: Decoded image width in pixels when known, without reading '
                                               'pixels.\n'
                                               'height: Decoded image height in pixels when known, without reading '
                                               'pixels.\n'
